  "releaseNotes": "3.0.5 — Expand Shamsi 1405 holiday/occasion catalog (time.ir alignment).\n      3.0.4 — Refresh Shamsi 1404–1405 holiday catalog (bahesab/time.ir alignment)\n      and Hijri calendar calibration.\n      3.0.3 — Package metadata and docs cleanup (Aminovate ownership).\n      3.0.2 — Fix AddDays/Add* mutating the receiver, which shifted monthly calendar\n      days by one and made holidays/Fridays appear as working days. Fridays now also\n      get weekend holiday metadata. GenerateMonthlyCalender matches yearly calendar.\n      3.0.1 — Time.ir-aligned official holidays for Shamsi 1403–1406 (Hijri calibration\n      through lunar 1449), occasion catalog refresh, and yearly sync tooling.\n      3.0.0 — Initial ParsKit release.",
